 "notes": [
  "The post's 'Starting (10)' section (There Is Good In Him / I Can Save Him, Luke Skywalker Rebel Scout, Luke's Lightsaber, Endor Landing Platform, Endor Chief Chirpa's Hut, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Draw Their Fire, Do Or Do Not & Wise Advice, I Feel The Conflict) repeats cards that are listed again in the type sections, so it is not counted separately; the type sections are dested. Qty 62 as published (sections 10+20+6+6+12+7+1).",
  "The author's update says only one of Draw Their Fire or Do, Or Do Not & Wise Advice starts, the other starting card being Staging Areas. Several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Posted 'Prepared Defenses' (a Dark Interrupt) on this Light list dested Heading For The Medical Frigate, the Light starting Interrupt also named in the starting section.",
  "Posted 'ASP- 707' dested ASP-707 (Ayesspee); 'LE- BO2D9' LE-BO2D9 (Leebo); 'Baragwain' Baragwin; 'Chewbacca or Kashyyyk' Chewbacca Of Kashyyyk (one card, typo for 'of'); 'Pulse Skater' Pulsar Skate; 'Lando In Falcon' Lando In Millennium Falcon; 'Frozzen Assets' Frozen Assets; 'EPP Han/Leia' Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol, Leia With Blaster Rifle. Anakin Skywalker is the Death Star II Interrupt (listed under Interrupts).",
